# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the image runs. Everything else, such as the
# tests, .env, screenshots and local caches, stays out.
*
!app.py
!movierec/
!templates/
!static/
!requirements.lock.txt
# The Kaggle CSVs and the refreshed catalogue, when present; CI builds without them and
# mounts the fixture dataset. An image built with them holds TMDb data: never push it.
!dataset/tmdb_5000_movies.csv
!dataset/tmdb_5000_credits.csv
!dataset/refreshed/tmdb_5000_movies.csv
!dataset/refreshed/tmdb_5000_credits.csv

# Leftovers inside the allowed folders
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
